sequenceDiagram
    participant Browser as Browser<br/>(React SPA)
    participant CloudRun as Cloud Run LB<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Express as Express BFF<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant GitHub as GitHub API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant GCS as Google Cloud Storage<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant GIQ as GKE Recommender<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over Browser,GCS: Flow 1: Benchmark Data Retrieval

    Browser->>CloudRun: GET /api/gcs/{bucket}/{path}<br/>TLS 1.2+
    CloudRun->>Express: Forward (plaintext internal)
    Express->>GCS: GET storage.googleapis.com<br/>Bearer (ADC), TLS 1.2+
    GCS-->>Express: Benchmark YAML data
    Express-->>CloudRun: Parsed JSON response
    CloudRun-->>Browser: HTTPS response

    Note over Browser,GCS: Flow 2: Results Store Submission

    Browser->>CloudRun: POST /api/results<br/>X-Prism-Github-Token header
    CloudRun->>Express: Forward with token
    Express->>GitHub: GET /user, /orgs<br/>Bearer (user token), TLS 1.2+
    GitHub-->>Express: User identity + org membership
    Express->>GCS: GET prism-iam/allowlist<br/>Bearer (ADC), TLS 1.2+
    GCS-->>Express: Admin allowlist
    Express->>GCS: PUT result object<br/>Bearer (ADC), custom metadata
    GCS-->>Express: Write confirmation
    Express-->>CloudRun: 201 Created
    CloudRun-->>Browser: HTTPS response

    Note over Browser,GitHub: Flow 3: GitHub OAuth Authentication

    Browser->>CloudRun: GET /api/auth/github/login
    CloudRun->>Express: Forward
    Express-->>Browser: 302 Redirect to github.com/authorize
    Browser->>GitHub: GET /login/oauth/authorize<br/>client_id, scope
    GitHub-->>Browser: Authorization prompt
    Browser->>GitHub: User approves
    GitHub-->>CloudRun: GET /api/auth/github/callback?code=xxx
    CloudRun->>Express: Forward with code
    Express->>GitHub: POST /login/oauth/access_token<br/>client_id + client_secret
    GitHub-->>Express: Access token + refresh token
    Express-->>Browser: Redirect with token in hash fragment

    Note over Browser,GIQ: Flow 4: GIQ Infrastructure Query

    Browser->>CloudRun: GET /api/giq/{path}<br/>Optional Bearer token
    CloudRun->>Express: Forward
    Express->>GIQ: GET gkerecommender.googleapis.com<br/>Bearer (ADC or user), TLS 1.2+
    GIQ-->>Express: Infrastructure profiling data
    Express-->>CloudRun: JSON response
    CloudRun-->>Browser: HTTPS response
